{"id":"poing","lemma":"poing","pos":"noun","rank":2549,"glosses":["fist"],"ipa":"/pwɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/48/Fr-poing.ogg/Fr-poing.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"poings"},"formAudio":{"poings":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-poings.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il frappa du poing sur la table.","en":"He banged on the table with his fist.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hit","l":"frapper"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"table"}]},{"text":"J'ai serré les poings.","en":"I clenched my fists.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1098018","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"tight"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Les mots font plus mal que les poings.","en":"Words hurt more than fists.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"word","l":"mot"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"harm, pain, evil"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Le lâche est le premier à lever le poing.","en":"The coward is the first to raise his fist.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"loose, slack"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"first"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to raise, lift"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le voleur était pieds et poings liés.","en":"The thief was bound hand and foot.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"robber, thief"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"foot","l":"pied"},{"g":"and"},null,null]}]}